0..77 Comment "// What a forward flow between data types does not decide yet, after directed"
78..151 Comment "// univalence (Gratzer, Weinberger and Buchholtz, _Directed univalence in"
152..230 Comment "// simplicial homotopy type theory_, arXiv:2407.09146, Definition 1.2): a data"
231..309 Comment "// type is covered constructor by constructor only when each field is a closed"
310..385 Comment "// type of the vocabulary, so a field naming a parameter and a type holding"
386..460 Comment "// itself are refused. Each refusal names the issue whose steps take them."
461..463 Comment "//"
